    <item>
      <title>StupidMirror 0.5.1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:33:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202610231117</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Recordings run to the moment <code>stop_recording</code> is called. When the screen stayed still at the end (an Android device only sends frames when its screen changes), the last frame was not held, so browsers and other players ended the video early.</li><li><code>install_app</code> reports a missing file or the wrong package type for the device as <code>invalid_argument</code> instead of <code>control_failed</code>.</li></ul>]]></description>
